{"ID":"20230925154735-eldem7x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154735-eldem7x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154735-eldem7x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154739-55j1h92\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154739-vd6i7d9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154739-vd6i7d9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"【千金-防己汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154739"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154739-55j1h92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154739-55j1h92","updated":"20230925154739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：防己四两、茯苓四两、白术四两、桂心四两、生姜四两、乌头七枚、人参二两、甘草三两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154739-wzdgctt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154739-wzdgctt","updated":"20230925154739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一碗醋，十碗水，煮成三碗半，分四次喝；乌头要炮黑、炮焦使用（炮黑才不毒）；"}]},{"ID":"20230925154739-vd6i7d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154739-vd6i7d9","updated":"20230925154739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（当然今天煮防己汤，可能乌头用蜜来提炼再混合会比较安全）"}]}]}